From: Neal Gompa <ngompa@fedoraproject.org>
Date: Fri, 24 Jan 2025 16:10:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] Drop Hyprland entry for Wayland window managers

Fedora LXQt is not supporting Hyprland
---
 config/waylandwindowmanagers.conf | 3 ---
 1 file changed, 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/config/waylandwindowmanagers.conf b/config/waylandwindowmanagers.conf
index 0beb4f0..c55533b 100644
--- a/config/waylandwindowmanagers.conf
+++ b/config/waylandwindowmanagers.conf
@@ -1,8 +1,5 @@
 [KnownManagers]
 
-Hyprland/Name=Hyprland
-Hyprland/Comment=Independent, highly customizable, dynamic tiling Wayland compositor
-
 kwin_wayland/Name=KWin-Wayland
 kwin_wayland/Comment=Window manager of the KDE Software Compilation
 
